{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-06T00:41:01Z","thinking":"The webpage returned a 200 status, and the text \"법인등록번호 : 131111-0605021\" was found within its content. The checksum will be computed for the given registration number using the specified weights to validate its authenticity. After calculation, the result suggests a remainder of 9; the checksum digit is thus derived to confirm the validity.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nasync function test() {\n  try {\n    const res = await fetch('https://bizno.net/article/7658500671', {\n      headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n    });\n    console.log('Status:', res.status);\n    const text = await res.text();\n    const m = text.match(/[0-9]{6}-[0-9]{7}/g);\n    console.log('Found corp matches:', m);\n    const idx = text.indexOf('법인등록번호');\n    if (idx !== -1) {\n      console.log('Context:', text.substring(idx - 50, idx + 200).replace(/\\s+/g, ' '));\n    } else {\n      console.log('No 법인등록번호 found in text');\n    }\n  } catch (e) {\n    console.error(e);\n  }\n}\ntest();\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\extract_corporate_numbers","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing Hwaseung Corporation branch","toolSummary":"Test Hwaseung Corporation branch"}}]}
